msgid ""
"Applies to manga without a per-manga override. When a chapter is manually "
"marked read, removes its downloaded file but keeps reading data. If a "
"chapter is still downloading, request deletion again after it finishes. "
"Turning this off does not cancel deletion requests already accepted."
msgstr ""
"适用于没有单独设置删除策略的漫画。在插件中手动将章节标为已读时删除下载文件，"
"但保留阅读数据。如果章节仍在下载，请在下载完成后再次请求删除。关闭此设置不会"
"取消已接受的删除请求。"

